# 🧠 SIH Problem Statement Deep Analysis

## AI-Powered Cognitive Gaming & Memory Assistance Platform for Elderly Dementia Patients in North-Eastern India

> **Overall Assessment:** The problem statement addresses a significant healthcare and social challenge among elderly dementia patients in North-Eastern India. The solution should go beyond basic cognitive games approach as "just another brain-game app." 
Basic gaming technology alone is not sufficiently innovative. The key differentiation should come from **cultural adaptation + multilingual voice interaction + adaptive cognitive profiling + caregiver workflow + offline-first architecture + evidence-based design**.


